13
00:00:49,226 --> 00:00:50,932
SUCCESS alone is not enough.

14
00:00:50,932 --> 00:00:55,704
RouteTill independently checked the recipient, token, amount and finalized receipt.

15
00:01:01,450 --> 00:01:06,257
Only after the merchant receipt was verified did RouteTill deliver the file.

16
00:01:06,257 --> 00:01:07,348
One entitlement.

17
00:01:07,348 --> 00:01:09,031
The exact approved bytes.

18
00:01:09,031 --> 00:01:13,687
The signed Purchase Passport connects the approval, payment and file digest.

19
00:01:13,687 --> 00:01:16,438
